    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u0x4](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u0x4) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 52.054 depth occurred on Oct 08 2026 25km S of Glan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 5.6006 longitude 125.1521. It impacted 248142 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
